{"id":"379ec8aa07ef0712","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-selector.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive4 Borel Selector","display":"df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-selector — ZFC Descriptive4 Borel Selector","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-selector","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-selector"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-selector — ZFC Descriptive4 Borel Selector","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-selector"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-selector</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-selector — ZFC Descriptive4 Borel Selector"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal B,E,s,x,y,z,B\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal B,E,s,x,y,z,B\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4BorelSelector}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4BorelSelector}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对函数图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 与集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}\">\\(f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}\\)</span>；函数图及定义域使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}borel\\text{-}selector}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4BorelSelector}_S(X,\\mathcal B,E,s)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,X)\n\\land E\\subseteq X\\times X\n\\land\\bigl[\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,x\\rangle\\in E)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\bigl[\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\to\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in E)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\bigl[\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in E)\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in E)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Function}(s,X,X)\n\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(s^{-1}[B]\\in\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\bigl[\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,s(x)\\rangle\\in E)\\bigr]\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\to s(x)=s(y)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}borel\\text{-}selector}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4BorelSelector}_S(X,\\mathcal B,E,s)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,X)\n\\land E\\subseteq X\\times X\n\\land\\bigl[\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,x\\rangle\\in E)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\bigl[\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\to\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in E)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\bigl[\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in E)\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in E)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Function}(s,X,X)\n\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(s^{-1}[B]\\in\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\bigl[\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,s(x)\\rangle\\in E)\\bigr]\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\to s(x)=s(y)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> is required to be an equivalence relation; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> is then a Borel measurable, class-constant choice of a representative.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"对函数图 $f$ 与集合 $B$，$f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}$；函数图及定义域使用 [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal B,E,s,x,y,z,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4BorelSelector}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}borel\\text{-}selector}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4BorelSelector}_S(X,\\mathcal B,E,s)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,X)\n\\land E\\subseteq X\\times X\n\\land\\bigl[\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,x\\rangle\\in E)\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\bigl[\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\to\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in E)\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\bigl[\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in E)\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in E)\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Function}(s,X,X)\n\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(s^{-1}[B]\\in\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\bigl[\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,s(x)\\rangle\\in E)\\bigr]\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\to s(x)=s(y)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false}],"bytes":1863,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1839","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-selector.md|58-df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-selector]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a740bdad87b97ac6","36d7463d215be751"]}